This fixture is DISTRIBUTION-ONLY. It must never be copied to a consumer.

It is the MUTATION BATTERY behind `derivation-differential`. It edits COPIES of
`core/skills/ai-dlc-update/reconcile/derivation-differential.sh`, which is core's own source,
and drives the shipping fixture against each copy to prove that its arms can fail: the
base side ignored, the stamp-equality refusal restored, the two sides swapped, and the
broken-root refusal dropped. It locates that source and the reconcile directory under
`core/`, and neither exists at that path in a consumer tree.

A consumer needs the behaviour, and `derivation-differential` ships and asserts it through the
real helper. This battery shows that those assertions are load-bearing, which is a claim about
this repository's suite and gives a consumer nothing to act on.
